    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400309/1004003090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、色々な経験が\r\n恋鐘を成長させていくんだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今までも、これからも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
